  {
   "id": "ex1",
   "type": "example",
   "problem": {
    "en": "With fixed capital, TP of labour for 1 to 5 workers is 10, 24, 36, 44 and 48 units. Find AP and MP for each worker."
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "en": "AP = TP/L: 10/1 = 10, 24/2 = 12, 36/3 = 12, 44/4 = 11, 48/5 = 9.6."
    },
    {
     "en": "MP = TP(L) − TP(L−1): 10, 14, 12, 8, 4."
    },
    {
     "en": "Check: 10 + 14 + 12 + 8 + 4 = 48 = TP of 5 workers."
    }
   ],
   "answer": {
    "en": "AP = 10, 12, 12, 11, 9.6; MP = 10, 14, 12, 8, 4."
   },
   "narration": {
    "en": "Let us work this out together. With fixed capital, TP of labour for 1 to 5 workers is 10, 24, 36, 44 and 48 units. Find AP and MP for each worker."
